NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-05 - Radio Waves
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2000: Guiding Stars

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:39.800
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:40.077 --> 00:00:43.378
Got a stack of blank cassettes by my stereo deck

00:00:43.518 --> 00:00:47.200
Gonna stay up late, what the heck

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.800
The DJ's voice is a trusted friend

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:54.500
On this signal that will never end

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:58.000
He's playing all the hits I know

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.200
Putting on a late-night show

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.200
Just for me and all the other kids

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.800
Living life out on the skids

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:10.500
We're living on the radio waves tonight!

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:14.800
Everything's gonna be alright!

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:18.500
Just turn it up, don't let it fade!

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.200
A perfect memory being made!

00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:26.777
Yeah, we're living on the radio waves!

00:01:28.074 --> 00:01:31.478
Got my finger on the record and the pause

00:01:31.938 --> 00:01:35.200
Breaking all of gravity's laws

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.500
Gotta get the timing just right

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:42.200
To make a perfect mixtape in the fading light

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:45.500
For a long drive in a beat-up car

00:01:45.893 --> 00:01:49.200
Underneath a million stars

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:52.000
This plastic box of tangled thread

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:54.637
